Apologies for the delays.  We had thought we fixed this issue but it appears we have not.  We've determined that the column name "Number of Proteins" and "Number of Protein Groups" is not compatible with our software (typically, those column names are "# Proteins" and "# Protein Groups" respectively).

Is this issue still occurring?  By any chance, could you provide us the version of ProteomeDiscoverer that you use?  Our hypothesis is that for older versions of PD, it uses the column name "# Proteins" & "# Protein Groups", but for newer versions of PD, it uses "Number of Proteins" and "Number of Protein Groups".

