Hi,

are 100% log2FCs missing?
Models are NULL because by default groupComparison does not return them. You can change that with the "save_fitted_models" option. That might help debugging.
I would start by looking at summarized data and see if there are non-missing values for each of the compared conditions in protein-level data.
You can access those via quant.diann$ProteinLevelData. Please let me know if found the source, if not, we'll keep looking for it.

KInd regards,
Mateusz

