Hi,

yes, please add a letter before the numbers. This should fix the issue.

If the design is group comparison, you need to adjust BioReplicate / Subject labels, too. They should be a concatenation of your current GROUP and SUBJECT column (Condition and BioReplicate in input).
Currently, MSstats recognizes this design as repeated measures cause subject IDs are shared between conditions. They should be nested within conditions. Simple paste(Condition, BioReplicate, sep = "_") will do.

Kind regards,
Mateusz

