Hi,

Comparing different heart regions & male/female conditions should be possible.  With your example, you can define your conditions as RV_Male, RV_Female, LV_Male, LV_Female in the annotation file.

With this setup, you should be able to do specific group comparisons easily, e.g. RV_Male vs RV_Female.  In order to do group comparisons between whole groups (i.e. RV vs LV), you can refer to this post <https://groups.google.com/g/msstats/c/if-rvt8rhqI> which outlines how that would be performed.

Thanks,
Tony

